  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 81f69e20efc4da349862ebeb8d902688, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Letter
  trTitle: Dr.Wilson
  trContent: "\"E\u011Fer bu notu okuyorsan, kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitledi\u011Fimi
    \xE7oktan anlam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n demektir. Buradan ka\xE7man\u0131n tek bir
    yolu var ama \xF6nce \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131 kapatman gerekecek. Unutma,
    o seni karanl\u0131kta g\xF6remiyor ama sesini duyabiliyor...\""
  enTitle: Dr.Wilson
  enContent: '"If you''re reading this note, it means you''ve already realized that
    I''ve locked the doors. There''s only one way to escape from here, but first
    you''ll have to turn off the light. Don''t forget, it can''t see you in the dark,
    but it can hear you..."'
